{"t":"Dragon Hoards (Book)","s":"dragon-hoards-book-cd600","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Book_Green_973561.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Presumed Places of Dragon Hoards in Tibia</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Book (Green)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Green_973561.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Isle%20of%20the%20Kings\">Isle of the Kings</a>.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"blurb\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Short Description</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The rumoured whereabouts of some of the fabled dragon hoards.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"author\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Author</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatedpages\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Related Articles</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragons\">Dragons</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/the-first-dragon-quest\">First Dragon Quest</a>.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"returnpage\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Return to</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Isle of the Kings Library.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">11.03.4221<br/>December 15, 2016</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Libraries <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This book has no notes.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-text\">\n<blockquote class=\"book\"><p><br/>Presumed Places of Dragon Hoards in Tibia<br/><br/>ruins in the northern part of the Jakundaf desert<br/>Kazordoon, in vicinity to the Colossus Fortress<br/>Treasure Island<br/>Dragon lair in the western part of the Kha'Zeel Mountains<br/>Banuta, supposedly not underground<br/>a ruined fortress in the north of Edron<br/>somewhere on Draconia<br/>high up in one of the towers of Vengoth Castle<br/>somewhere in Zzaion<br/>in the Crystal Gardens of Nargor<br/>in the icy mountains of the island Okolnir<br/>in the dragon graveyard of Drefia<br/>deep in the caverns of the Oramond Mountains<br/>in the foothills of Krailos<br/>on the Isle of Evil<br/>in spider-infested caves underneath Trapwood<br/>underneath the graveyard of Yalahar<br/>in the Ghostlands near Carlin<br/>in the dragon caves underneath the Darama desert</p></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["the-first-dragon-quest"]}